  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div><ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Áp dụng công thíre <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>h</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>′</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>, với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Ta có <div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>7</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div></li><li>Áp dụng công thức <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>h</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ol></div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/295682dc9d3f12345bdc44afdf876f9346c92c1dfbd26516ee1bbe7e4527ebc1.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
